# Normalise to LF in the repo. Run files, qrels and configs are consumed by
# tools (trec_eval, awk pipelines) that are not reliably CRLF-tolerant, and a
# checkout that rewrote them would make our files disagree with everyone else's.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.parquet binary
*.npy binary
*.zip binary
